cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying benchmark, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "Swiss River Network Benchmark: Spatio-Temporal River Water Temperature Modeling"
abstract: >-
  Swiss River Network Benchmark is an open-source benchmark for spatio-temporal river water
  temperature forecasting. It provides three graph datasets (swiss-1990, swiss-2010, zurich),
  reference implementations of LSTM, Graphlet, ST-GNN, Transformer and graph-aware Transformer
  variants, Ray Tune hyperparameter search, a window-length sweep driver, Gaussian/impulse
  noise robustness experiments, and the visualization notebooks that produce every figure in
  the accompanying paper.
